  "description": "Barcode/QR analyzer for the Shiny CameraView. Reads codes with the native scanner — Apple Vision (iOS/macOS) and Android MLKit, with the managed ZXing.Net decoder on Windows and bare net10.0 — and has a LongRange mode for codes across a room: it locates codes first, reads 1D codes with a blur-tolerant managed decoder, hands 2D codes to the native scanner as enlarged crops, tracks codes across frames and can zoom in on codes too small to read.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
